<p>A powerful earthquake of about magnitude 7.4 struck early Thursday in the Molucca Sea between Sulawesi and Maluku. Sources placed the epicentre roughly 120-127 km from Ternate and the depth at about 35 km. Authorities and media reports said one person was killed, another was injured, and several buildings were damaged, including a building collapse in Manado, North Sulawesi. The quake initially triggered tsunami warnings, but officials later lifted them after only small waves were reported, easing fears of a wider regional threat. The earthquake was another reminder of Indonesia’s exposure to seismic hazards as a vast archipelago on active fault lines, even as the lifted warning pointed to a more limited coastal impact than first feared.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/CtosRnBBmcPF1Hi8skttFjqBOUmTz7FmygxMc4y3rzL8DxSxmlFMc8qlMXSQMNRrKpPXNysKtX0k1LrFxer4KmHEUFvx4eqh2sumL5P-Y9rCR4w_-DjxsV2XVaTXmOUb62RZPbljCE_Lcsf5syT6iDaSKzmhJE_Gf63333eYisZdH7KtIcQWUMrydx3hvFontUm7vsqa' alt='Image accompanying reports on the offshore Indonesia earthquake and tsunami alert.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Wave heights: Indonesia’s meteorology agency BMKG said tsunami waves reached five locations, with the highest measured at 0.75 metre in North Minahasa, North Sulawesi.</li><li>Aftershocks tracked: BMKG recorded about 50 aftershocks after the main quake, with the largest reaching magnitude 5.8.</li><li>Magnitude revision: Early reports and alerts listed the earthquake as magnitude 7.8 before later assessments from multiple outlets and USGS settled on 7.4.</li><li>Morning timing: The earthquake struck at about 6:48 a.m. local time, which helps explain why many residents were awake and able to react quickly.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>BMKG: Indonesia’s meteorology agency said tsunami waves reached five places and recorded roughly 50 aftershocks after the main shock. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/southeast-asia/article/3348725/tsunami-warning-indonesia-philippines-malaysia-after-maluku-sea-quake'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>USGS: The US Geological Survey put the quake at a shallow depth of 35 km in the Molucca Sea between the Sulawesi and Maluku island groups. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/74-magnitude-earthquake-off-indonesia-coast-sets-of-small-tsunami-warning-lifted/article70814035.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Regional authorities: Officials lifted the tsunami warning after the initial concern passed, signaling that the broader coastal danger had receded despite localized damage. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cn53krrrr24o'>BBC News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/74-magnitude-earthquake-off-indonesia-coast-sets-of-small-tsunami-warning-lifted/article70814035.ece'>Earthquake off Indonesia topples buildings, kills 1, sets off small tsunami</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/indonesia-strong-earthquake-strikes-molucca-⁠sea-killing-1/a-76634417'>Indonesia: Strong earthquake strikes Molucca ⁠Sea, killing 1</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cn53krrrr24o'>Magnitude 7.4 earthquake hits off Indonesia, killing one</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/powerful-7-8-magnitude-earthquake-hits-indonesia-tsunami-warning-issued-11299496#publisher=newsstand'>1 Dead, Buildings Damaged In 7.4 Earthquake In Indonesia, Tsunami Warning Lifted</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/indonesia-molucca-sea-earthquake-tsunami/'>Magnitude 7.4 earthquake strikes off Indonesia&#x27;s coast, killing 1 person</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/southeast-asia/article/3348725/tsunami-warning-indonesia-philippines-malaysia-after-maluku-sea-quake'>Indonesia earthquake kills 1, triggers tsunami waves</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/02/magnitude-78-earthquake-strikes-in-i